---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PricingSection from '../components/PricingSection.astro';
const schema = { '@context': 'https://schema.org', '@type': 'SoftwareApplication', name: 'Aura: Looksmaxxing', applicationCategory: 'LifestyleApplication', operatingSystem: 'Web', offers: [{ '@type': 'Offer', name: 'One report', price: '2.99', priceCurrency: 'USD' }, { '@type': 'Offer', name: 'Monthly subscription', price: '9.99', priceCurrency: 'USD' }, { '@type': 'Offer', name: 'Annual subscription', price: '49.99', priceCurrency: 'USD' }] };
---
<BaseLayout title="Pricing — One Report or a Subscription | Aura" description="Start with a free potential preview. Unlock a full report for $2.99 once, or choose $9.99 monthly / $49.99 yearly for recurring credits.">
  <Fragment slot="head"><script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(schema)} /></Fragment>
  <header class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 pt-16 text-center"><h1 class="text-5xl font-black">Aura pricing</h1><p class="mt-5 text-[#aaa] text-lg">See your preview before choosing what to buy.</p></header>
  <PricingSection />
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 pb-16"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">What happens after I upload?</h2><ol class="list-decimal pl-5 mt-5 space-y-3 text-[#aaa]"><li>Choose a tool and upload a photo without creating an account.</li><li>See your estimated styling potential. The detailed result stays locked.</li><li>Create an account to keep the result, then pay $2.99 once to unlock it. Existing paid credits can also unlock a report.</li></ol>
    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">One purchase, one practical report</h2><p class="mt-4 text-[#aaa] leading-relaxed">Your chosen tool determines the report: facial observations, a haircut shortlist, a four-week planner or a focused feature analysis. It does not include every tool at once. The $2.99 Starter Pack adds five credits; unlocking one tool report uses those five credits. Your unlocked report stays available in your account.</p>
    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">How subscriptions work</h2><p class="mt-4 text-[#aaa] leading-relaxed">Monthly and annual subscriptions provide 100 credits per month. A report unlock uses five credits and a hairstyle try-on uses two, from the same balance. Monthly subscription credits reset and do not roll over. Cancel in your account before renewal to stop the next charge; access continues until the paid period ends.</p>
    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">Your photos and results</h2><p class="mt-4 text-[#aaa] leading-relaxed">The public tools send your photo to our AI processing service to create the report. Aura does not save the original upload for these tool reports. Unclaimed previews are accessible for 24 hours and saved unpaid previews for seven days. Unlocked reports remain in your account. See our <a href="/privacy" class="text-fuchsia-300">privacy policy</a> for details about processing and other app features.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
